    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/c883c7ca6050bb65165dc80b749310ed.poster.avif?t=1740418416\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/c883c7ca6050bb65165dc80b749310ed.webm?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/c883c7ca6050bb65165dc80b749310ed.mp4?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game of Survival and Strategy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Squid Plays Game</i>, a multiplayer experience where every move counts. Compete in high-stakes challenges and fight to be the last one standing. Can you survive and claim the prize?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting and Familiar Games</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play intense games with simple rules but deadly consequences. From balancing acts to marbles, every challenge will test your mind and courage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/9fb5b344c5bf03ce7e5072d9ea4eed76.poster.avif?t=1740418416\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/9fb5b344c5bf03ce7e5072d9ea4eed76.webm?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/9fb5b344c5bf03ce7e5072d9ea4eed76.mp4?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Character</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your mark in the game! Choose from custom outfits and styles to build a character that stands out in the crowd.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Up or Go Solo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends or face off against strangers. Build alliances, make enemies, and decide who you can trust in this unpredictable game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Beat the Odds?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking. Join <i>Squid Plays Game</i> and prove you have what it takes to survive and win. Your life in the game depends on it!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/c883c7ca6050bb65165dc80b749310ed.poster.avif?t=1740418416\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/c883c7ca6050bb65165dc80b749310ed.webm?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/c883c7ca6050bb65165dc80b749310ed.mp4?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game of Survival and Strategy</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Squid Plays Game</i>, a multiplayer experience where every move counts. Compete in high-stakes challenges and fight to be the last one standing. Can you survive and claim the prize?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exciting and Familiar Games</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play intense games with simple rules but deadly consequences. From balancing acts to marbles, every challenge will test your mind and courage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/9fb5b344c5bf03ce7e5072d9ea4eed76.poster.avif?t=1740418416\" width=800 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/9fb5b344c5bf03ce7e5072d9ea4eed76.webm?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356330/extras/9fb5b344c5bf03ce7e5072d9ea4eed76.mp4?t=1740418416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Character</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your mark in the game! Choose from custom outfits and styles to build a character that stands out in the crowd.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Up or Go Solo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends or face off against strangers. Build alliances, make enemies, and decide who you can trust in this unpredictable game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Can You Beat the Odds?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock is ticking. Join <i>Squid Plays Game</i> and prove you have what it takes to survive and win. Your life in the game depends on it!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Enter Squid Plays Game, a multiplayer survival challenge where childhood games turn deadly. Customize your character, outwit rivals, and face relentless trials. Every choice counts\u2014win it all or lose everything. Can you survive the chaos and claim ultimate victory?",
